# 21. Complete Attack Chain

The complete attack chain was:

```text
1. Discover MCP configuration
          ↓
2. Recover exposed credentials
          ↓
3. Authenticate to MCP service
          ↓
4. Inspect JWT
          ↓
5. Discover alg=none support
          ↓
6. Forge JWT with admin role
          ↓
7. Access administrative tool registration
          ↓
8. Inspect OpenAPI specification
          ↓
9. Discover arbitrary code field
          ↓
10. Register custom Python tool
          ↓
11. Achieve OS command execution
          ↓
12. Discover execution as mcp UID 1000
          ↓
13. Discover Kubernetes environment
          ↓
14. Locate ServiceAccount token
          ↓
15. Query Kubernetes API
          ↓
16. Enumerate RBAC permissions
          ↓
17. Discover nodes/proxy
          ↓
18. Discover kubelet access
          ↓
19. Enumerate kubelet pods
          ↓
20. Find privileged node-exporter pod
          ↓
21. Identify /host/root mount
          ↓
22. Execute command through kubelet
          ↓
23. Read host root flag
```

